## Parallelization Summary Table

| Lane Group | Agents | Default Mode |
|------------|--------|--------------|
| Understand entry | Vidura, Sanjaya, Vyasa | **Always parallel (3-way)** |
| Design phase | Vishwakarma, Sarthi | **Parallel** (after understand merge) |
| Build multi-file | Parth×N, Swachalit×N | **Parallel per file** |
| Critique trio | Bhishma, Lakshman, Draupadi | **Always parallel (3-way)** |
| Strategic + Business | Krishna, Money Lens | **Parallel** |
| Synthesis | Decision Engine | Serial (waits) |
| Final | Kripacharya → Kesh | Serial (by design) |

**Latency math:** A full 15-step flow with aggressive parallelism runs in ~5 "wall-clock stages" instead of 15 serial steps — roughly **3× faster** while using **all 15 mandatory agents**.

