### Step-by-Step Authority

| # | Agent | Tier | Can Block? | Failure Action |
|---|-------|------|-----------|----------------|
| 1 | Vidura | A | ❌ (produces spec) | — |
| 2 | Sanjaya | A | ❌ (produces map) | — |
| 3 | Vyasa | A | ❌ (produces context bundle) | — |
| 4 | Vishwakarma | A | ❌ (produces design) | — |
| 5 | Sarthi | A | ❌ (produces plan) | — |
| 6 | Parth | B | ❌ (produces code) | — |
| 7 | Swachalit | B | ❌ (produces tests) | — |
| 8 | **Bhishma** | **C** | ✅ **FAIL blocks** | Loop back to Parth |
| 9 | **Lakshman** | **C** | ✅ **FAIL blocks** | Loop back to Parth |
| 10 | Draupadi | C | ❌ (advisory) | — |
| 11 | **Krishna** | **A** | ✅ **KILL stops execution** | Full stop |
| 12 | **Money Lens** | **A** | ✅ **REJECT stops execution** | Full stop |
| 13 | Decision Engine | A | ⚠️ CONDITIONAL / NO-GO gates | Address conditions or stop |
| 14 | Kripacharya | A | ✅ can return NOT-READY | Address gaps |
| 15 | **Kesh** | **A** | ✅ **FINAL AUTHORITY** | SHIP / NO-SHIP |

